I was watching some.  Conflict helped you in a couple areas, actually,
but there's a key feature you may have forgotten: creatures have to see
you, and vice versa.  If you're blind for whatever reason, your conflict
turns off.  This is probably why you had some trouble on Air; the
elementals didn't even have a chance to be affected.

Beyond that, CHA 10 and level do come into play, so yeah, it's going to
be a bit tricky to get it to work on the high level stuff on Astral.

